@page
@model Personal_DevelopmentModel
@using System.Globalization
@{
    var isDutch = CultureInfo.CurrentCulture.Name.Equals("nl-NL", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase);
    ViewData["Title"] = isDutch ? "Persoonlijke Ontwikkeling" : "Personal Development";
    ViewData["SeoTitle"] = isDutch ? null : "Personal Development & Coaching | iD! Training & Development";
    ViewData["MetaDescription"] = isDutch ? null : "Personal development and coaching for when you're ready to reconnect with yourself, make a change, or find your own way forward.";
}

<section class="public-hero-page"><div class="public-container"><div class="public-hero-grid"><div>
    <p class="public-eyebrow public-eyebrow-left">@(isDutch ? "Persoonlijke Ontwikkeling" : "Personal Development")</p>
    <h1 class="public-hero-title mx-0">@(isDutch ? "Voor als ‘Is dit het nu?’ door je hoofd blijft spoken" : "For when \"is this really it?\" keeps circling in your head")</h1>
    <p class="public-hero-copy mx-0">@(isDutch ? "Misschien herken je het: aan de buitenkant klopt alles — baan, huis, een vol weekend. En toch knaagt er iets. Een gevoel dat je anders naar de wereld kijkt dan de mensen om je heen, of dat je onderweg een stukje van jezelf bent kwijtgeraakt." : "You might recognize the feeling: from the outside, everything checks out. A job, a home, maybe a family, plans every weekend. And yet something keeps nagging. A sense that you see the world just a little differently from the people around you, or that somewhere along the way, you've lost a piece of yourself.")</p>
    <div class="public-actions justify-start"><a href="https://koalendar.com/e/meet-with-id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="public-btn public-btn-primary">@(isDutch ? "Plan een gesprek" : "Book a conversation") <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a><a asp-page="/contact" class="public-btn public-btn-outline">@(isDutch ? "Contactformulier" : "Contact form") <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div>
</div><div class="public-hero-note"><h2>@(isDutch ? "Daar komen wij in beeld" : "That's where we come in")</h2><p class="public-copy">@(isDutch ? "Niet als mensen met alle antwoorden, maar als gidsen die zelf ook weleens de weg kwijt waren." : "Not as people with all the answers, but as guides who've lost our own way once or twice too, and who use that experience to help you find yourself again.")</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="public-section"><div class="public-container public-content-narrow mx-auto"><p class="public-eyebrow public-eyebrow-left">@(isDutch ? "Onze aanpak" : "Our approach")</p>
@if (isDutch) { <p class="public-copy">We zijn geen coaches die achterover leunen en hummen; die titel hangen we dan ook liever niet aan onszelf. We denken mee, spiegelen, stellen de vraag die je ontwijkt, en lachen onderweg mét jou. Geen helden op een voetstuk, maar ervaringsdeskundigen met een scherpe blik voor blinde vlekken.</p><p class="public-copy">We hebben zelf ons leven meerdere keren omgegooid, soms bewust, soms gedwongen. We weten hoe het is om grote keuzes te maken zonder zicht op de afloop. Die ervaring gebruiken we om jou sneller bij je eigen antwoorden te brengen.</p> }
else { <p class="public-copy">We're not coaches who lean back and hum along — so we'd rather not give ourselves that title. We think with you, reflect, ask the question you're avoiding, and laugh with you along the way. No heroes on a pedestal, but people with real-life experience and a sharp eye for blind spots.</p><p class="public-copy">We've both turned our lives upside down more than once: sometimes by choice, sometimes because we had no other option. We know what it's like to make big decisions without knowing where they'll lead. We use that experience to help you get to your own answers faster.</p> }
</div></section>

<section class="public-section public-section-soft"><div class="public-container"><div class="public-two-column"><div><p class="public-eyebrow public-eyebrow-left">@(isDutch ? "Voor wie" : "Who this is for")</p><h2 class="public-section-title">@(isDutch ? "Voor mensen die zich vaak ‘anders’ voelen" : "For people who often feel \"different\"")</h2><p class="public-copy">@(isDutch ? "Nieuwsgierig naar zichzelf en de wereld, met gevoel voor humor (ook over hun eigen worstelingen), en het besef dat groeien soms ongemakkelijk moet zijn voordat het lucht geeft." : "For people who are curious about themselves and the world, who have a sense of humour — including about their own struggles — and who understand that growth can feel uncomfortable before it brings relief.")</p></div><div><p class="public-eyebrow public-eyebrow-left">@(isDutch ? "Waar we je bij helpen" : "What we can help you with")</p><ul class="public-check-list"><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>@(isDutch ? "Grenzen stellen zonder dat het als ruzie voelt" : "Setting boundaries without it feeling like a fight")</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>@(isDutch ? "Je kwaliteiten zichtbaar maken" : "Making your qualities visible")</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>@(isDutch ? "Omgaan met conflict en moeilijke gesprekken" : "Dealing with conflict and difficult conversations")</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>@(isDutch ? "Communiceren onder druk" : "Communicating under pressure")</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>@(isDutch ? "Grote keuzes: emigreren, wisselen van baan, een ander leven beginnen" : "Big choices: emigrating, changing jobs, starting a different life")</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>@(isDutch ? "Interculturele vraagstukken" : "Intercultural questions")</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>@(isDutch ? "Leiderschap vanuit wie je bent, niet wie je denkt te moeten zijn" : "Leadership from who you are, not who you think you should be")</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>@(isDutch ? "Patronen doorbreken die zich blijven herhalen" : "Breaking patterns that keep repeating")</li></ul></div></div></div></section>

<section class="public-section"><div class="public-container"><div class="public-section-heading public-section-heading-center"><p class="public-eyebrow">@(isDutch ? "Hoe we werken" : "How we work")</p></div><div class="public-feature-grid xl:grid-cols-4"><article class="public-feature-card"><h3>@(isDutch ? "1-op-1 begeleiding" : "One-on-one guidance")</h3><p class="public-copy">@(isDutch ? "Jij, één van ons, een gesprek zonder oordeel." : "You, one of us, and a conversation without judgment. Sometimes you need a sounding board; sometimes someone needs to hold a mirror up to you. Often, both.")</p></article><article class="public-feature-card"><h3>@(isDutch ? "Relatiebegeleiding" : "Relationship guidance")</h3><p class="public-copy">@(isDutch ? "Voor twee (of meer) mensen die samen vastlopen." : "For two (or more) people who keep getting stuck together. We help make the conversation possible again — honestly, safely, and with room for everyone's perspective.")</p></article><article class="public-feature-card"><h3>@(isDutch ? "Training persoonlijke ontwikkeling" : "Personal development training")</h3><p class="public-copy">@(isDutch ? "Kleinere groep, thema's als assertiviteit of leiderschap." : "For smaller groups, around themes such as assertiveness, self-confidence, communication, or leadership. Always practical, always personal.")</p></article><article class="public-feature-card"><h3>@(isDutch ? "Teambegeleiding" : "Team guidance")</h3><p class="public-copy">@(isDutch ? "Zie Voor Organisaties." : "For teams that want to work better together. See Organizations for more information.")</p></article></div><p class="public-copy mx-auto mt-10 max-w-3xl text-center">@(isDutch ? "Alles is maatwerk; de prijs bepalen we na het (gratis) eerste gesprek." : "The first conversation is free. We listen to what is going on, what you need, and whether we are the right people for you. Everything is tailor-made, and we agree on the price after that conversation.")</p><div class="public-actions"><a href="https://koalendar.com/e/meet-with-id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="public-btn public-btn-primary">@(isDutch ? "Plan een gesprek" : "Book a free conversation") <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a><a asp-page="/contact" class="public-btn public-btn-outline">@(isDutch ? "Contactformulier" : "Contact form") <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div></div></section>
